From 3e61efcce7a8f2c133222ba0c48beadf9ff6b933 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:55:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] Fix the XD hook: XD changes the header game code when
 it sends a program

On hardware XD replaced "TEST" at 0xAC with its own value (its loader
keeps that value and its link code checks for "TEST"), so the v0.5 hook
never recognised XD's programs. The hook now ignores the header: the
received program is recognised by its compressed code and loader, the
decompressed one by everything after its header.

The hook's entry stays where the released v0.5 hook had LinkHook
(0x089C20D1), through a veneer, so Emerald's link code on a v0.5 cart is
already right and only the hook's block is rewritten. The flasher (v0.4)
accepts up to three earlier states per area and make_flasher.py adds the
v0.5 state from linkhook_v0.5.bin. Tests send XD's programs with the
header changed as XD does, and update a v0.5 cart with power cuts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014JPQshc9oBXnzvR2E67Khm
